and what is even happening here?

306
00:17:50.390 --> 00:17:52.180
Like between us?

307
00:17:53.060 --> 00:17:54.310
Uh...

308
00:17:55.395 --> 00:17:58.008
I guess. uh. I kind of felt

309
00:17:58.010 --> 00:18:00.565
like maybe we would
be a thing. you know?

310
00:18:00.567 --> 00:18:02.692
No? Uh... I don't know.

311
00:18:02.694 --> 00:18:04.947
'Cause you're. like.
the first actual guy

312
00:18:04.949 --> 00:18:06.296
I've kissed who's. like. kissed me back.

313
00:18:06.298 --> 00:18:07.948
And you're a real non-imaginary person.

314
00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:11.785
Okay. Tyler is in school.
Like. nothing happened.

315
00:18:11.787 --> 00:18:14.079
What? How? We...

316
00:18:14.081 --> 00:18:16.206
- What do you mean?
- I don't fucking know.

317
00:18:16.208 --> 00:18:18.959
Tony says we're not supposed to
tell anyone. and he'll deal with it.

318
00:18:18.961 --> 00:18:19.961
And he will.

319
00:18:21.463 --> 00:18:23.223
- Hey.
- Can we just...

320
00:18:24.716 --> 00:18:28.296
Look. I have history.
I have my interview later. and...

321
00:18:29.245 --> 00:18:30.345
Yeah.

322
00:18:30.347 --> 00:18:31.347
Okay.

323
00:18:32.141 --> 00:18:33.849
St. George!

324
00:18:33.851 --> 00:18:35.351
Got the math answers or what?

325
00:18:37.085 --> 00:18:38.505
