328
00:19:21.273 --> 00:19:23.403
"Gordon Lightfoot. Urgent".

329
00:19:25.360 --> 00:19:27.280
Yeah. I'm. uh...

330
00:19:29.198 --> 00:19:30.618
I'm ignoring that shit now.

331
00:19:32.951 --> 00:19:35.371
Did you really tell Winston?

332
00:19:36.496 --> 00:19:39.372
- What the fuck were you thinking?
- That I was gonna die.

333
00:19:39.374 --> 00:19:40.884
We're all gonna fucking die!

334
00:19:42.211 --> 00:19:44.711
Question is. do you wanna die in jail?

335
00:19:44.713 --> 00:19:47.714
You know. I get it. you hate Jess.
but what the fuck about Alex?

336
00:19:47.716 --> 00:19:48.716
I don't hate...

337
00:19:51.553 --> 00:19:53.183
I don't hate anybody. okay?

338
00:19:53.981 --> 00:19:55.431
I didn't mean to make things worse.

339
00:19:55.433 --> 00:19:58.099
I was stoned. I thought I was gonna die.

340
00:19:58.101 --> 00:20:00.894
And that drill was
just so fucked-up. so...

341
