match. Easy. all good.

355
00:20:45.565 --> 00:20:46.690
Okay.

356
00:20:46.692 --> 00:20:48.650
- Ted. need you in back.
- Got it.

357
00:20:48.652 --> 00:20:50.395
All right. get that in ASAP.

358
00:20:50.397 --> 00:20:52.468
'Cause that McConnell kid wants to fight

359
