360
00:20:54.533 --> 00:20:56.491
You good? You eating right?

361
00:20:56.493 --> 00:20:57.993
- Yeah. sure.
- Yeah? You sure?

362
00:20:57.995 --> 00:20:59.369
- Yeah.
- Pow. pow. pow!

363
00:20:59.371 --> 00:21:01.035
We got it all set up with the Down kid

364
