Clay.

367
00:21:42.247 --> 00:21:44.622
It's not appropriate for you to be here.

368
00:21:44.624 --> 00:21:46.458
No. I know. I'm... I'm sorry.

369
00:21:46.460 --> 00:21:48.089
I didn't know what else to do.

370
00:21:48.091 --> 00:21:49.794
I'm required to inform the police.

371
00:21:49.796 --> 00:21:52.797
Call the police. you'll never
see me again.

372
00:21:52.799 --> 00:21:55.967
I just... I'm so tired.

373
00:21:55.969 --> 00:21:57.054
And I can never sleep.

374
00:21:57.056 --> 00:21:59.596
and I don't want to
feel this way anymore.

375
00:21:59.598 --> 00:22:00.915
It's like this buzz in my head

376
00:22:00.917 --> 00:22:02.682
