louder and louder.

377
00:22:02.684 --> 00:22:04.225
and I think it's killing me.

378
00:22:04.227 --> 00:22:05.847
And I don't want to die. and...

379
00:22:06.688 --> 00:22:08.228
I just... I need this to stop.

380
00:22:09.399 --> 00:22:11.229
Can you please help me make it stop?

381
00:22:15.822 --> 00:22:18.122
Wait here.

382
00:22:19.868 --> 00:22:21.868
We'll go to my office. We'll talk.

383
00:22:23.372 --> 00:22:25.497
Then we'll both do what we have to do.

384
00:22:25.499 --> 00:22:26.499
All right?

385
00:22:44.559 --> 00:22:46.399
You avoided me at school today.

386
00:22:47.521 --> 00:22:49.437
Skipped our classes.

387
00:22:49.439 --> 00:22:52.524
Yeah. I needed to take
care of a situation.

388
00:22:52.526 --> 00:22:54.026
Now I gotta go. so...

389
00:22:55.070 --> 00:22:56.070
Diego?

390
00:22:56.947 --> 00:23:00.073
Yes. Do you wanna say
something about it?

391
00:23:00.075 --> 00:23:01.616
- I don't.
- Mm-hmm.

392
00:23:01.618 --> 00:23:02.742
Really.

393
00:23:02.744 --> 00:23:06.621
'Cause I don't think you get to
say anything about who I sleep with.

394
00:23:06.623 --> 00:23:07.982
I know what I'm doing.

395
00:23:07.984 --> 00:23:08.998
I know.

396
00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:13.340
I just wanted to say thank
you for letting me stay.

397
00:23:16.091 --> 00:23:17.341
I'm moving out tonight.

398
00:23:22.514 --> 00:23:24.472
You're going back to Oakland?

399
00:23:24.474 --> 00:23:26.057
No.

400
00:23:26.059 --> 00:23:30.395
Ironically. my mum insists that
