- No. he's still upstate.

558
00:34:18.127 --> 00:34:19.946
We checked with the Bureau of Prisons.

559
00:34:19.948 --> 00:34:21.707
and there's no sign of foul play.

560
00:34:24.342 --> 00:34:25.966
She OD'ed?

561
00:34:25.968 --> 00:34:27.548
