624
00:39:04.246 --> 00:39:05.788
Clay. what does that mean?

625
00:39:05.790 --> 00:39:08.290
I don't... I don't understand
what's happening.

626
00:39:08.292 --> 00:39:11.382
I'm. like... I'm grounded forever. I...

627
