697
00:43:15.914 --> 00:43:16.914
Um...

698
00:43:18.584 --> 00:43:21.209
Uh... making them.

699
00:43:21.211 --> 00:43:22.211
the robots.

700
00:43:23.422 --> 00:43:24.422
Okay.

701
00:43:25.424 --> 00:43:28.300
