732
00:45:23.751 --> 00:45:24.751
And...

733
00:45:28.380 --> 00:45:29.380
Uh...

734
00:45:30.507 --> 00:45:31.507
Uh. yeah.

735
00:45:38.056 --> 00:45:41.436
Uh. I don't... I don't
want Clay to know.

736
00:45:42.835 --> 00:45:43.935
Um...

737
00:45:43.937 --> 00:45:47.022
He needs to get better. and. um...

738
00:45:49.318 --> 00:45:53.236
I don't really want to
be in the way of that.

739
00:45:53.238 --> 00:45:54.488
You could never.

740
00:45:57.785 --> 00:46:00.115
