748
00:46:20.849 --> 00:46:22.809
She didn't. really.

749
00:46:23.685 --> 00:46:25.602
Maybe we take a day...

750
00:46:25.604 --> 00:46:26.614
... as a family.

751
00:46:27.523 --> 00:46:29.356
We could scatter her ashes in the river.

752
00:46:29.358 --> 00:46:31.488
I don't fucking want anything! Okay?

753
00:46:35.906 --> 00:46:38.073
I don't need some bullshit service

754
00:46:38.075 --> 00:46:41.576
