about some broke junkie being dead!

755
00:46:41.578 --> 00:46:42.828
Jesus!

756
00:46:42.830 --> 00:46:43.830
Fuck!

757
00:46:51.171 --> 00:46:52.171
Sorry.

758
00:46:53.674 --> 00:46:56.675
Uh. I just... I've been to
enough funerals in my life.

759
00:46:56.677 --> 00:46:58.757
- Of course.
- Justin. love.

760
00:47:01.473 --> 00:47:02.643
