I always imagined I'd be...

788
00:50:03.071 --> 00:50:07.491
getting Bryce ready to go off
to college right about now.

789
00:50:08.744 --> 00:50:11.036
His father and I. um...

790
00:50:11.038 --> 00:50:13.418
put away some money
